            "text": "NIST Atomic Spectra Database (Kramida, A., Ralchenko, Yu., Reader, J. and NIST ASD Team), rest wavelengths of atomic lines",
            "url": "https://physics.nist.gov/asd"
          },
          {
            "text": "Osterbrock, D. E. and Ferland, G. J. 2006, Astrophysics of Gaseous Nebulae and Active Galactic Nuclei, 2nd edn, University Science Books: the nebular line list (H I, [O II], [O III], [N II], [S II], He I, He II)",
