            "text": "Gray, R. O. and Corbally, C. J. 2009, Stellar Spectral Classification, Princeton University Press: which absorption lines mark each spectral class (Balmer lines strongest near A0; Ca II H and K, the G band and metal lines in G and K; TiO bands in M; He I in B, He II in O)",
            "url": "https://press.princeton.edu/books/hardcover/9780691125107/stellar-spectral-classification"
